 safe-/
 round
 round-using
 round-to
 match-sign  ; only used in `minimize'?
 
 LU-decomposition
 LU-back-substitution
 LU-solve
 int-delta
 
 log2
 safe-add--log2
 safe->--log
 calculate-entropy
 int-code-length
 comb-code-length
